The domain is on their email. The code lives on their laptop. Only they know the server password.

3
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:13,180
You paid for it. But you're renting your own website.

4
00:00:13,494 --> 00:00:16,224
Here are the three keys you must own.

5
00:00:16,722 --> 00:00:20,892
One. Your domain. The registrar account, on your own email.

6
00:00:20,994 --> 00:00:25,724
Two. Your code. The GitHub repository, in your own account.

7
00:00:25,824 --> 00:00:30,554
Three. Your hosting. The server or cloud login, in your hands.

8
00:00:30,654 --> 00:00:32,584
You paid for it. Own the keys.

9
00:00:32,813 --> 00:00:36,983
Do you have all three? Comment own it, or not sure.

